{"schemaVersion":1,"unitId":"u058","words":[{"word":"knock","phonetic":"/nɒk/","meanings":[{"meaning":"敲","pos":"verb","usage":"敲门的声音"},{"meaning":"打"},{"meaning":"撞击（指用拳头或其他物体敲击门、窗等） noun. 敲击声"}]},{"word":"quiet","phonetic":"/ˈkwaɪət/","meanings":[{"meaning":"安静的","pos":"adj","usage":"形容没有声音或很安静的环境"},{"meaning":"寂静的"}]},{"word":"impossible","phonetic":"/ɪmˈpɒsəbl/","meanings":[{"meaning":"不可能的","pos":"adj","usage":"表示某事不可能发生或做到"}]},{"word":"invite","phonetic":"/ɪnˈvaɪt/","meanings":[{"meaning":"邀请","pos":"verb","usage":"请人到某处或参加某活动"}]},{"word":"garden","phonetic":"/ˈɡɑːdn/","meanings":[{"meaning":"花园","pos":"noun","usage":"房屋周围种植花草蔬菜的地方"},{"meaning":"庭院"}]},{"word":"lemonade","phonetic":"/ˌleməˈneɪd/","meanings":[{"meaning":"柠檬水","pos":"noun","usage":"用柠檬制成的饮料"},{"meaning":"柠檬饮料"}]},{"word":"joke","phonetic":"/dʒəʊk/","meanings":[{"meaning":"开玩笑","pos":"verb","usage":"以幽默方式说话或做事"}]},{"word":"left","phonetic":"/left/","meanings":[{"meaning":"剩余的","pos":"adj","usage":"表示某物还剩多少，常与none连用"},{"meaning":"剩下的"}]},{"word":"glass","phonetic":"/ɡlɑːs/","meanings":[{"meaning":"玻璃杯","pos":"noun","usage":"用于喝水的杯子，或玻璃这种材料"},{"meaning":"玻璃"}]},{"word":"beer","phonetic":"/bɪə/","meanings":[{"meaning":"啤酒","pos":"noun","usage":"一种含酒精的饮料"}]},{"word":"sure","phonetic":"/ʃɔː/","meanings":[{"meaning":"确信的","pos":"adj","usage":"表示对某事很有把握"},{"meaning":"肯定的"}]},{"word":"warm","phonetic":"/wɔːm/","meanings":[{"meaning":"温暖的","pos":"adj","usage":"形容温度不冷不热"},{"meaning":"暖和的"}]},{"word":"anything","phonetic":"/ˈeniθɪŋ/","meanings":[{"meaning":"任何事","pos":"pron","usage":"用于否定句和疑问句"},{"meaning":"任何东西"}]},{"word":"nothing","phonetic":"/ˈnʌθɪŋ/","meanings":[{"meaning":"没有什么","pos":"pron","usage":"表示什么都没有"},{"meaning":"无物"}]},{"word":"everybody","phonetic":"/ˈevribɒdi/","meanings":[{"meaning":"每个人","pos":"pron","usage":"指所有的人"},{"meaning":"所有人"}]}],"phrases":[{"phrase":"knock again","usage":"再敲一次门","examples":[{"en":"I'll knock again, Helen.","zh":"我再敲一次，海伦。"}]},{"phrase":"look through the window","usage":"透过窗户看","examples":[{"en":"Look through the window.","zh":"透过窗户看看。"}]},{"phrase":"try the back door","usage":"试试后门","examples":[{"en":"Let's try the back door.","zh":"我们试试后门吧。"}]},{"phrase":"have lunch","usage":"吃午饭","examples":[{"en":"Everybody wants to have lunch in the garden.","zh":"大家想在花园里吃午饭。"}]},{"phrase":"come and have something to drink","usage":"来喝点东西","examples":[{"en":"Come and have something to drink.","zh":"来喝点东西吧。"}]},{"phrase":"have a glass of beer","usage":"喝一杯啤酒","examples":[{"en":"May I have a glass of beer please?","zh":"请给我一杯啤酒好吗？"}]},{"phrase":"none left","usage":"没有剩余","examples":[{"en":"There's none left.","zh":"没有剩余了。"}]},{"phrase":"be joking","usage":"在开玩笑","examples":[{"en":"She's only joking.","zh":"她只是在开玩笑。"}]},{"phrase":"nice and warm","usage":"暖和舒适的","examples":[{"en":"It's nice and warm out here.","zh":"外面很暖和舒适。"}]},{"phrase":"knock, knock","usage":"用于引起注意或开始讲笑话的拟声词","examples":[{"en":"Knock, knock!","zh":"咚咚咚！"}]}],"grammar":[{"title":"否定疑问句 (Negative Questions)","structure":"Isn't/Don't/Can't + 主语 + ...?","definition":"由否定词not与助动词/系动词/情态动词构成的疑问句，用于表达惊讶、确认或期望肯定回答 表达惊讶或难以置信的语气，或期望对方确认","examples":[{"en":"Isn't there anyone at home?","zh":"难道没有人吗？"}]},{"title":"some和any的用法 (Some and Any)","structure":"some + 可数名词复数/不可数名词；any + 可数名词复数/不可数名词","definition":"some用于肯定句，any用于否定句和疑问句 表示一些/任意数量的某物","examples":[{"en":"Can you see anything?","zh":"你能看见什么东西吗？"},{"en":"Everything's very quiet.","zh":"一切都很安静。"}]},{"title":"Let's 引导的建议句型 (Let's for Suggestions)","structure":"Let's + 动词原形","definition":"Let's = Let us，用于提出建议或邀请 建议一起做某事","examples":[{"en":"Let's try the back door.","zh":"我们试试后门吧。"},{"en":"Let's have a drink.","zh":"我们喝一杯吧。"}]}],"patterns":[{"pattern":"Isn't there + anyone/someone + at home?","original":{"en":"Isn't there anyone at home?","zh":"难道没有人吗？"},"imitations":[{"en":"Isn't there any milk?","zh":"难道没有牛奶了吗？"},{"en":"Isn't there anyone in the room?","zh":"难道房间里没有人吗？"}]},{"pattern":"Can you see + anything/something?","original":{"en":"Can you see anything?","zh":"你能看见什么吗？"},"imitations":[{"en":"Can you see anyone?","zh":"你能看见什么人吗？"},{"en":"Can you see something in the box?","zh":"你能看见盒子里有什么东西吗？"}]},{"pattern":"Let's + 动词原形","original":{"en":"Let's try the back door.","zh":"我们试试后门吧。"},"imitations":[{"en":"Let's have lunch together.","zh":"我们一起吃午饭吧。"},{"en":"Let's go to the garden.","zh":"我们去花园吧。"}]},{"pattern":"May I have + a glass of + 名词?","original":{"en":"May I have a glass of beer please?","zh":"请给我一杯啤酒好吗？"},"imitations":[{"en":"May I have a glass of water?","zh":"请给我一杯水好吗？"},{"en":"May I have some lemonade?","zh":"请给我一些柠檬水好吗？"}]}],"text":[{"lesson":116,"title":"A","kind":"课文 · 对话","lines":[{"en":"I did nothing."},{"en":"I saw no one."},{"en":"I went nowhere."},{"en":"I met nobody."},{"en":"B No, I didn't hear anything. I heard nothing."},{"en":"No, I didn' t speak to anyone. I spoke to nobody."},{"en":"No,I didn't go anywhere. I went nowhere."},{"en":"No, I didn't buy anything. I bought nothing."},{"en":"No,I didn't write to anybody. I wrote to nobody."},{"en":"No, I didn't meet anyone. I met no one."},{"en":"C Everyone's looking out of the window."},{"en":"Everyone's hurrying to work."},{"en":"Everyone's eating."},{"en":"Everyone's drinking lemonade."},{"en":"D No, I haven't got anything to eat. I've got nothing to eat."},{"en":"He's got something to eat."},{"en":"No, I haven't got anything to do. I've got nothing to do."},{"en":"They've got something to do."},{"en":"No, I haven't got anything to drink. I've got nothing to drink."},{"en":"She's got something to drink."},{"en":"No, I haven't got anything to read. I've got nothing to read."},{"en":"He's got something to read."},{"en":"[email protected]"}]}]}